            "sid": "2KI 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo geeraharusmoó slaqwaruuseerós oo hatlá' nee múk hatlá' oo mibeeri kooán gay ya/aáw as Eliya nguwa huwiya'. Inós iri tsa/án gawaá tlooma amór Eliya, i kaahi, «Aá heé Mungú, waawutmo i kaahi, ‹Aweeráng gawaasinge ar gaanslaay.› »",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
